["<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">海流</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かいりゅう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">洋流；海流</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"185016\"><ruby>海流<rp>(</rp><rt>かいりゅう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>変化<rp>(</rp><rt>へんか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>起<rp>(</rp><rt>お</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>きたのだろうか。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">海流有变化吗?</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">改良</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かいりょう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">改良；改进；改革</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"217256\">コンピューターはたえず<ruby>改良<rp>(</rp><rt>かいりょう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>されている。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">计算机不断改进。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">回路</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かいろ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">电路；循环（如克雷布斯循环）；循环；回路</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">海路</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かいろ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">副词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">副詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">海路；海上航线</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"390718\"><ruby>陸路<rp>(</rp><rt>りくろ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>運<rp>(</rp><rt>はこ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ぶのは<ruby>大変<rp>(</rp><rt>たいへん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ですが、<ruby>海路<rp>(</rp><rt>かいろ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>で<ruby>運<rp>(</rp><rt>はこ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ぶのは<ruby>簡単<rp>(</rp><rt>かんたん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>です。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">地面交通很困难,但在海上交通很容易。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">会話</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かいわ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">对话；谈话；闲谈</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"210516\">その<ruby>作家<rp>(</rp><rt>さっか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>会話<rp>(</rp><rt>かいわ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>書<rp>(</rp><rt>か</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>くのがうまい。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">这位作家很好地写讲话。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">買う</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">买</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\">スーパーで<ruby>野菜<rp>(</rp><rt>やさい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>買<rp>(</rp><rt>か</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いました。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">在超市买了蔬菜。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">飼う</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">饲养；饲育；养；喂养</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"198980\">ナンシーは<ruby>犬<rp>(</rp><rt>いぬ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>飼<rp>(</rp><rt>か</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いたがっていますか。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">纳西想要狗吗?</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">帰す</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かえす</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">遣回；送回；让…回家</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"75041\">けがを<ruby>治療<rp>(</rp><rt>ちりょう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>してもらったトラは、<ruby>村人<rp>(</rp><rt>むらびと</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>たちの<ruby>手<rp>(</rp><rt>て</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>で<ruby>無事<rp>(</rp><rt>ぶじ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>、<ruby>保護区<rp>(</rp><rt>ほごく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>帰<rp>(</rp><rt>かえ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>された。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">受伤的老虎被村民手中安全地返回保护区。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">返す</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かえす</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">归还；返还；放回；翻转；倒转；颠覆；偿还；报复；回报；回应；顶嘴；回答；反驳；反向做……（如反驳；反扔）；再做；反复做</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"149018\"><ruby>車<rp>(</rp><rt>くるま</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はいつ<ruby>返<rp>(</rp><rt>かえ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>したらいいでしょうか。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">什么时候可以把车还回来?</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">却って</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かえって</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">副词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">副詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">反而；倒是；反倒；更加</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"173181\"><ruby>高望<rp>(</rp><rt>たかのぞ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>みをするとかえって<ruby>損<rp>(</rp><rt>そん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>をする。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">希望,而不是失去。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">帰り</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かえり</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">回来；返回</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"201483\">どうして<ruby>帰<rp>(</rp><rt>かえ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>りがこんなに<ruby>遅<rp>(</rp><rt>おそ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>くなったの。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">你为什么这么晚回家？ <a class=\"ex-attribution\" href=\"https://tatoeba.org/sentences/show/905345\" title=\"Tatoeba · Martha\" aria-label=\"Tatoeba · Martha\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">↗</a></span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">省みる</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かえりみる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅱ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅱ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">反省；回顾；审视；思考</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">顧みる</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かえりみる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅱ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅱ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">回顾；反思；追忆；向后看；回头看；扭身看；考虑；留意；注意；放在心上</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">代える</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かえる</s