3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅱ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅱ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">替换；转换；改变；交换；互换；更新；替代（人员、职员、选手等）</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">替える</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かえる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅱ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅱ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">替换；转换；改变；交换；互换；更新；替代（人员、职员、选手等）</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"227392\">お<ruby>花<rp>(</rp><rt>はな</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>水<rp>(</rp><rt>みず</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>替<rp>(</rp><rt>か</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>えましょう。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">换花的水。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">返る</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かえる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">返回；回来；回去；翻转；翻身；变得极其；完全变成</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"198548\">のろいはのろい<ruby>主<rp>(</rp><rt>ぬし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>返<rp>(</rp><rt>かえ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>る。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">可怕的回归主。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">家屋</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かおく</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">房屋；建筑物</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">顔付き</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かおつき</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">面容；面貌；神情；表情</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"101834\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>怒<rp>(</rp><rt>おこ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>った<ruby>顔<rp>(</rp><rt>かお</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>つきで<ruby>外<rp>(</rp><rt>そと</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>へでてきた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">他带着愤怒的面孔走出去。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">香り</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かおり</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">香气；芳香；香味；气味</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"212720\">そのバラはよい<ruby>香<rp>(</rp><rt>かお</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>りを<ruby>発散<rp>(</rp><rt>はっさん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>した。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">那朵玫瑰散发了好气味。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">抱える</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かかえる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/kanji/\">N3</a><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/kanji/\">N2</a><span class=\"v-m\">抱着；承担（问题）</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span class=\"lx-src\"><span class=\"t-zh\">汉字 </span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">漢字 </span><a href=\"../n2/kanji/\" lang=\"ja\">抱</a></span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">価格</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かかく</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">价格；价值