ja\">かかわる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">参与；涉及；牵扯；干预；关联；相关；涉及；有关；影响；关系重大；有重大影响；坚持；执着；讲究；在意</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"218476\">これは<ruby>我<rp>(</rp><rt>わ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>校<rp>(</rp><rt>こう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>名誉<rp>(</rp><rt>めいよ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>にかかわる<ruby>問題<rp>(</rp><rt>もんだい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>だ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">这是我们学校的荣誉问题。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">課外</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かがい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">课外</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">化学</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かがく</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">化学</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"183002\"><ruby>貴方<rp>(</rp><rt>あなた</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は、<ruby>化学<rp>(</rp><rt>かがく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>勉強<rp>(</rp><rt>べんきょう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>しますか。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">你想学习化学吗?</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">科学</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かがく</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">科学；科学地思考；从科学角度思考<